      "compound_label": "1",
      "compound_name": "Yb(III) dithionite/sulfinate complex [{(η5-C5Me5)2Yb(μ3,1κ2O1,3,2κ3O2,2′,4-S2O4)}2{(η5-C5Me5)Yb(μ,1κO,2κO′-C5Me5SO2)}2]",
